# "Teach first" pattern lessons: a short rule, three illustrated examples where Turkish and Albanian pieces
# share colours (so the learner SEES where a Turkish suffix goes), then targeted fill-in-the-gap drills in full sentences.
# Colours: 0 blue (content), 1 red (the grammar point), 2 green, 3 gold.
# Example: (speaker, mood, scene, [turkish blocks], [albanian blocks], albanian sentence, turkish sentence)
# Drill:   (sentence with ___, options (correct first), turkish, why)
